# QA DoD-4: 2P split-screen, vertical (left/right) orientation, mixed devices: P1 keyboard A,
# P2 gamepad. Settings (split → Vertical, steering assist on) → Versus lobby → Backyard Bash, 1 lap,
# Rain (per-view rain) → P2 pauses with Start → resume → finish → results → scoreboard → Rematch →
# P1 pauses → quit.
#   cargo run -p recharged -- --user-data-dir target/qa/data/vs2v --window 1600x900 \
#     --input-script tools/scripts/qa/vs2_vertical.script --exit-after 600
wait ui
wait screen title                  # the splash ends after its fade (frame clock)
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # 2P split
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Vertical
0.6 shot vs2_01_split_setting
0.3 nav keyboardA prevTab          # Accessibility
0.6 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Steering assist
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.5 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Versus
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # P1 joins (Space)
0.5 nav gamepad confirm            # P2 joins (A)
0.5 nav gamepad right              # P2: Dumpster
0.8 shot vs2_02_lobby
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # P1 ready
0.3 nav gamepad confirm            # P2 ready → track select
2.5 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town
0.3 nav keyboardA right
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # options: Layout
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Mirror
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Laps 5
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # 1
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Rivals
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # AI difficulty
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Items
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Weather
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Cloudy
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Rain
0.6 shot vs2_03_track_select
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Time of day
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Start race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
1.0 shot vs2_04_countdown
wait racing
hold keyboardA throttle 1
hold gamepad throttle 1
@300 shot vs2_05_racing
@420 release keyboardA
@420 release gamepad
0.2 tap gamepad pause              # P2: Start
wait paused
1.0 shot vs2_06_p2_pause
0.3 nav gamepad confirm            # Resume (P2)
wait running
0.2 hold keyboardA throttle 1
0.0 hold gamepad throttle 1
wait finished
release keyboardA
release gamepad
3.5 shot vs2_07_results
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Continue
2.0 shot vs2_08_scoreboard
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Rematch
wait countdown
1.0 shot vs2_09_rematch_countdown
wait racing
@60 tap keyboardA pause
wait paused
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quit race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.4 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait menu
2.0 shot vs2_10_menu
1.0 exit
